    {
      "path": "/workspace/Rare-cancers/research/autonomy/fresh-discovery-2026-10-04-round3/REPORT.txt",
      "sha256": "ca2ac803561bdc6814019430053ab5aaa9f214e78ef6dc5b8d996cd11ae730bb",
      "bytes": 11698,
      "screen_scope": "ExactDLK1/ADCTtargetmentions infinal/index/baselinecheckpoint only;notfullprimary/scientificbodyevaluation",
      "matches": [
        {
          "line": 21,
          "text": "The DLK1 pilot is also complete and shelved. Its prospectively recorded appreciable-expression gate failed: median 0.18 TPM across 12 primary EMC specimens, with only two specimens at or above 10 TPM. Both high-expression, source-labelled fusion-positive specimens are retained. All six older EMC arrays, all ten GSE4303 specimens and three culture measurements were evaluated within their actual assay/mapping limits; independent reproduction confirmed the numerical results. Reference-relative array values cannot establish absolute absence, and USZ23 zeros apply to two mapped transcript rows, with historical-index completeness unresolved. This is failure of our proposed phenotype, not a useful negative paper challenging an established EMC claim. See dlk1/, dlk1_review/ and DLK1-LEAD-DECISION.json."
        },
        {
          "line": 23,
          "text": "The fixed mature-small-RNA question is now shelved. The selected ten-case Sapi assay measures only one DLK1-DIO3 member; the original 2013 sixteen-profile abstract and likely overlapping 2014 report expose no complete patient-level domain panel. The bounded public deposition trace authenticated no matching numerical source; this does not prove no deposit exists. Brenca PRJNA692081 was correctly reconciled to the earlier mixed patient/engineered-culture evaluation, not counted as 23 new patient tumors. Low DLK1 mRNA was not used as evidence about maternal mature-miRNA activity. The separate miR-10b trial question is also shelved: sponsor subject102-001 is labelled rectal cancer in the 2025 poster, myxoid chondrosarcoma in March2026 and EMC in June2026, without an explanation. Later repeated SD categories have no released EMC lesion kinetics or molecular measurements. Subject101-001 is specifically myxoid liposarcoma in earlier sources and is not a second EMC case. Phase0 breast-cancer delivery and blood-miRNA effects cannot substitute for EMC evidence. Independent reviews reproduce these source decisions. See small_rna/, mirna_deposition/, small_rna_review_final/, mirna_trial/ and mirna_trial_review/."
        },
        {
          "line": 41,
          "text": "Every file in the completed genomics, proteomics, immune, TNT, access, functional-discovery, imaging-discovery, liquid-biomarker and DLK1 packets was integrated and hash-verified into the lead worktree, together with the applicable independent reviews. The provisional small-RNA review is also frozen and integrated, with its pending scope retained. Their source/reproduction and independent review receipts remain explicit; this does not certify unpublished experiments, full public-evidence closure or publication readiness."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
