        {
          "line": 31,
          "text": "Earlier campaign decisions remain in R1\u2013R3 reports and coverage records, including shelved DLK1, mature-miRNA, matrix, secondary-genomic and clinical ideas. The submitted CSPG4 letter remains the empirical benchmark already audited in R1. TMEM266 remains shelved. No old favorable draft or ranking has been revived; no new manuscript drafted or advanced."
        }
